<html>
	<head>
		<title>Test HTA Application</title>
		<meta http-equiv="x-ua-compatible" content="ie=9">
		<hta:application 
			id="coolApp"
			applicationname="coolapp"
			version="1"
		</hta>
		<style type="text/css">
			body {
				background-image: url(BurningFlame0.gif);
				background-size: cover;
				background-repeat: no-repeat;
				color: white;
			}
			h1 {
				color: red;
			}
		</style>
		<script type = "text/vbscript">
			function executeTestDialog()
				a=MsgBox("Critical", 16, "TEST")
				a=MsgBox("Question", 32, "TEST")
				a=MsgBox("Exclamation", 48, "TEST")
				a=MsgBox("Info", 64, "TEST")
			end function
		</script>
	</head>
	
	<body>
		<h1>Super Cool Application For Testing My Themes! >:D</h1>
		<p>Yeah, it's just a bunch of scripts to test...<br/>Press some buttons and be happy.</p>
		<button onclick="executeTestDialog()">Click me to test dialogs!</button>
	</body>
</html>